window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>All Jordan Carver wanted to do was drift through Europe and decide what to do with his life.</b></p> <p>When the American student surprisingly inherits a flat from an old Professor he barely knew, he suddenly is hunted by assassins and caught up in an adventure that will lead him around the globe in a hunt for a relic that could alter human history... or end it.</p> <p>Relic <i>is a new standalone adventure novel by T.S. Falk, author of the acclaimed Ancient Secrets series. For fans of Michael Crichton, A.G. Riddle, and James Rollins.</i></p>"; 
